{
  "code": "QBP_E22",
  "name": "Query Authorization Request Status",
  "version": "HL7 v2.7",
  "chapter": "Query",
  "description": "This message is used to query the status of an Authorization Request. There are 2 types of queries handled by this message: 1) a specific Authorization Request or 2) a specific Product/Service Line Item. If a Provider wants to obtain information on a group of Authorization Requests (e.g., submitted in a date range), each individual Authorization Request must be queried.",
